      "subject": "toro e be go bao ba go hloilwego",
      "rationale": "Sefoko sa go loša bobe: 'toro ya gago e be ya manaba a gago' — motho wa mašutu a bolela gore se tla welo mong hae, e sego Danieli."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "לשנאיך \/ לעריך",
      "rationale": "Kopano ya mantsu a mabedi a go hloilega le a manaba — dikhutlo tša sepoko tše di theilwego godimo ga go hloya."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Moo Danieli, yo leina la gagwe e lego Beletšatsara, a tshwenyega nako e tee, gomme megopolo ya gagwe e mo tšhabiša. Kgoši a araba a re: Beletšatsara, toro le tlhaloso ya yona e se ke go go tšhabiša. Beletšatsara a araba a re: Mong wa ka, toro e be go bao ba go hloilwego, gomme tlhaloso ya yona go manaba a gago.",
